* ============================================================================
* MCP4451-103 - quad 8-bit (257-tap) I2C digital potentiometer, 10 kOhm, simple models (2026-09-29)
* Not a Microchip model.  Values from Microchip's MCP443X/5X data sheet DS22267A (read 2026-09-29):
*   RAB ................................ 10 kOhm, +/-20 % (8.0-12.0 kOhm) for the -103 option
*   taps ............................... 257; step RS = RAB/256
*   wiper position ..................... code 000h = wiper at terminal B (zero scale); 100h = wiper at terminal A
*                                        (full scale), so RWB = RAB * CODE/256 + RW
*   wiper resistance RW ................ 75 ohm typ, 160 ohm max (VDD 5.5 V)
*   power-on / brown-out wiper value ... mid-scale, 80h (CODE 128); the firmware must write the wanted code
*   terminal capacitances .............. CAW 75 pF, CW 120 pF, CBW 75 pF typ (1 MHz, full scale) -> to ground here
*   supply current ..................... 2.5 uA typ (5 uA max) with the I2C bus idle
*   RESET pin .......................... internal 16 kOhm typ pull-up to VDD
* On the board each pot has A = GND and B = the 22k/1k divider node, so a HIGHER code gives a LOWER LED current.
* The wiper drives only an op-amp input and 1 nF, so RW does not change the DC result.
* NOT MODELLED: RAB tolerance (+/-20 % shifts the 22k/1k divider by about 2 %), temperature, the I2C interface
* (the code is a parameter, not written over SCL/SDA), the HVC/A0 and A1 weak pull-ups (on only while VDD is below
* the ~1.65 V brown-out level, when A0 is latched).
*
* MCP4451_POT: one potentiometer (units A, B, C of U26 = P0, P1, P2).  Pins A W B.  Parameter CODE (0-256).
* MCP4451_CTRL: the control/supply unit (U26E).  Pins VDD VSS SCL SDA HVC/A0 A1 RESET.
* ============================================================================
.SUBCKT MCP4451_POT A W B PARAMS: CODE=128 RAB=10k RW=75
RB B WI {max(RAB*min(max(CODE,0),256)/256,1m)}
RA WI A {max(RAB*(256-min(max(CODE,0),256))/256,1m)}
RWP WI W {RW}
CA A 0 75p
CW W 0 120p
CB B 0 75p
.ENDS MCP4451_POT

.SUBCKT MCP4451_CTRL VDD VSS SCL SDA HVC_A0 A1 RESET
IDD VDD VSS 2.5u
RPU RESET VDD 16k
R2 SCL VSS 1G
R3 SDA VSS 1G
R4 HVC_A0 VSS 1G
R5 A1 VSS 1G
.ENDS MCP4451_CTRL
